ther dog.\n  - allergic to pets: Nate asked Joanna about her pet allergy severity, referencing a previous mention of the allergy.\n  - pet store: Nate saw a turtle at the pet store and purchased it, increasing his turtle collection as the tank can now hold three.\n  - cute pic: Nate shared a cute picture of his family with Joanna, asking why he hung it on his cork board. Joanna previously found the picture adorable and asked Nate why he chose them as pets.\n  - Nate: Nate acquired a new family addition named Max and expressed pride in Joanna for staying strong and being true to herself.\n  - Nate: Nate is an assistant who recently added a new family member named Max. He is communicating with Joanna about his busy week and Max.\n  - new pup: Nate told Joanna that he got a new pup for her.\n  - doggy playdates: Nate arranged doggy playdates for his new dog, Max, after meeting a local couple with a dog during a walk.\n  - Max: Nate took Max for a walk and met a nearby couple; they arranged doggy playdates, and Max likes the other dog, which Nate anticipates will be a great walking buddy.\n  - buddies: Nate referred to his little dudes as his buddies, noting they are calm and peaceful companions who enjoy their new, expanded tank.\n  - animals: Nate suggested Joanna write down things her animals like due to Joanna experiencing facial puffiness and itchiness around certain animals, causing avoidance.\n  - axiousness: Nate mentioned that Joanna has things to help her get through times of anxiousness, despite not being able to have animals.\n  - Nate: Nate made homemade coconut ice cream with sprinkles. His game tournament was postponed, and he didn't make the finals. He creates YouTube gaming content. He expressed support for Joanna filming her movie.\n  - figure: Nate mentioned that Iron Man is his top pick and he has a figure of him. Joanna later asked Nate what made him get that figure.\n  - similar interests: Joanna and Nate established they have similar interests, le