ose all her work, which was frustrating and depressing. Deborah offered support.\n  - daily routine: Jolene uses breathing, meditation, and yoga for challenges. Deborah meditates, does yoga, and teaches classes in the morning, jogs in a park, and spends evenings with loved ones.\n  - Jolene's mom: Jolene's mom cooked with Jolene, which brought everyone together. Jolene asked Deborah about her best memory of cooking with her mom.\n  - concentration: Jolene asked if video games help to improve concentration.\n  - video games: Jolene shared that her passion for video games started when her parents got her something related when she was 10 years old.\n  - birds: Deborah mentioned birds chirping reminded her of what really matters.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1890,"context_chars":7295,"retrieval_duration":0.25143957138061523,"response_duration":3.6532275676727295,"total_duration":3.9046671390533447,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer fails to provide any information about the games Jolene recommends for Deborah, which is the main focus of the question.","completeness_grade":"INSUFFICIENT","completeness_reasoning":"The context does not contain any specific recommendations from Jolene for Deborah regarding video games. While there are mentions of video games and some related discussions, none of the games listed in the golden answer (Zelda BOTW for Switch, Animal Crossing: New Horizons, Overcooked 2) are present in the context. Therefore, it lacks the critical information needed to answer the question.","missing_elements":["Zelda BOTW for Switch","Animal Crossing: New Horizons","Overcooked 2"],"present_elements":["Jolene asks Deborah if they ever play video games","Deborah prefers to play detective games together with others","Deborah mentioned a cat card game involving attacks","Deborah asked Jolene if she only plays old games or tries new ones","Deborah mentioned playing games with her husband as a way to bond","Jolene and her partner planned to pl