ce with others.\n  - dance session: Gina suggested planning a dance session with Jon soon. Jon confirmed dance practice has been fun and exhausting; he plans to go full-time with his business idea.\n  - aspiring dancers: Jon is excited to guide and mentor aspiring dancers on their dreams.\n  - dance floor: Jon's dance studio is facing challenges, but he is determined to make it work and rock the dance floor to teach others to chase their dreams.\n  - dance: Jon is rehearsing hard, working on business plans for his dance studio. Gina believes the studio will be a go-to spot for self-expression.\n  - Jon: Jon is starting a dance studio and received mentorship from a business professional. Gina expressed pride and support for Jon's endeavors.\n  - performances and judging: Jon's dance studio and other schools will participate in a creative night of performances and judging.\n  - choreography: Jon is finishing up choreography for a performance at a nearby festival next month; the group rehearses dances ranging from contemporary to hip-hop.\n  - friends: Gina mentioned being at dance class with a group of friends last Friday. She looks forward to Jon's studio being a go-to spot for self-expression.\n  - Jon: Jon runs a dance studio, has been rehearsing hard, and is working on business plans. Gina told Jon 'Just do it!' after he mentioned the stress.\n  - Jon: Jon started his own dance studio after losing his job. He finds starting the business scary but is driven by his love for dance, which has been a stress-buster since childhood.\n  - biz ventures: Jon is hitting the gym to stay on track with his venture; he recently had an awesome performance at a festival. Gina's store is growing.\n  - Jon: Jon is working hard on his business despite obstacles. Gina supports him, encouraging his drive and predicting he will succeed in a competition.\n  - Jon: Jon is running a business (dance studio), determined despite challenges, and asked Gina for marketing advice to reach his tar