hat the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Maria adopted a pup last week. (event_time: 2023-08-06T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria volunteers at the local dog shelter once a month. (event_time: 2023-06-03T11:51:00Z)\n  - Maria started volunteering at a local dog shelter once a month. (event_time: 2023-06-03T11:51:00Z)\n  - The pup adopted by Maria came from a shelter. (event_time: 2023-08-06T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria volunteers at the homeless shelter. (event_time: 2023-04-10T18:13:00Z)\n  - Maria engages in volunteering. (event_time: 2023-05-04T15:18:00Z)\n  - Maria's volunteering at the shelter involved giving people good food. (event_time: 2023-08-11T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria volunteered at the homeless shelter. (event_time: 2023-08-02T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria has been busy volunteering at the homeless shelter in the present time. (event_time: 2022-12-17T11:01:00Z)\n  - Maria reached out to the shelter asking if they needed volunteers. (event_time: 2022-08-03T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria was at the shelter (event_time: 2023-06-27T00:21:00Z)\n  - Maria recently gave talks at the homeless shelter where she volunteers. (event_time: 2023-04-10T18:13:00Z)\n  - Maria volunteered at a shelter last week (event_time: 2023-01-21T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria's volunteering at the shelter involved giving people beds, which are akin to homes. (event_time: 2023-08-11T00:00:00Z)\n  - Maria has been occupied with volunteering at the homeless shelter. (event_time: 2022-12-17T11:01:00Z)\n  - Maria is busy at the shelter. (event_time: 2023-05-25T13:24:00Z)\n  - Maria feels like she is making a difference through volunteering (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:43:00Z)\n  - Maria acknowledges that the other dog is always there for her and John. (event_