 mentioned a furry pal brightens her days. Previously, she congratulated John and is taking a poetry class.\n  - Animals: Maria has an energetic dog named Shadow that gets along with her other dog. John agrees that animals are priceless companions that bring peace and understanding.\n  - Maria: Maria has a high-energy dog named Shadow who gets along well with her other dog. She finds pets bring joy and inquired about John's mentoring program progress.\n  - shelter: Maria volunteered at the shelter last Friday, working the front desk and providing food/beds. John is considering looking into local shelters to potentially get a dog.\n  - Maria: Maria has a dog named Shadow, which gets along well with her other dog. She enjoys outdoor activities like hikes, picnics, and indoor activities like board games and movie nights.\n  - Maria: Maria volunteers at a homeless shelter, recently donated her old car there, and started practicing aerial yoga.\n  - Maria: Maria donated her old car to a homeless shelter she volunteers at. She enjoys watching movies, hiking, and having game nights with friends.\n  - volunteers: Maria volunteers at a homeless shelter after witnessing a family struggle on the streets about a year ago; she finds the experience fulfilling.\n  - volunteering at the homeless shelter: Maria participated in a 5K charity run last weekend for a homeless shelter, finding it rewarding and emphasizing the unity felt.\n  - talks: Maria gave several talks at the homeless shelter where she volunteers, finding the experience fulfilling and receiving compliments from other volunteers.\n  - Maria: Maria is volunteering at a homeless shelter, which she finds rewarding. She recently supported a woman going through a divorce, job loss, and homelessness.\n  - Maria: Maria enjoys uplifting experiences, wants to explore more, and plans to volunteer at shelters next month.\n  - Maria: Maria volunteers organizing meals at a homeless shelter. She discussed blogging with John, agreei