ver, a mix of highs and lows. Writing is an escape, a way to express feelings, and healing.\n  - feelings: Writing is a way for Joanna to express her feelings, act as an escape, put thoughts down, and create something good from them, as words have a magical way of healing.\n  - Rejections: Joanna received rejections from a film contest, which Nate acknowledged as tough but encouraged her to keep trying.\n  - activities you love: Joanna shared that writing projects are going well, describing the experience as a mix of highs and lows, and that her journal is her rock, viewing writing as a huge part of her life.\n  - love story: Joanna is writing a movie script for a love story that involves many challenges; she is working hard and hopes to see it on the big screen.\n  - hard work: Joanna found seeing her hard work in writing a movie script acted out on the big screen a surreal and satisfying experience, the third time this has happened.\n  - journey: Joanna values the journey, appreciating happy moments to stay focused on dreams, and looks forward to showing it to Nate.\n  - Joanna: Joanna is filming her own movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and is excited to show her vision.\n  - writer: Joanna, identified as a writer, experienced a major setback when her laptop crashed, resulting in the loss of all her work.\n  - inspiring quotes: Joanna's cork board is filled with inspiring quotes and pictures for motivation and creativity.\n  - creatures: Joanna noted that the creatures bring much calm and joy, and asked if taking care of them is tough.\n  - literature: Joanna advises reading lots, trying different genres, and writing/sharing literature to build understanding and improve through practice and feedback.\n  - dialogue: Joanna found it rewarding to see the dialogue she wrote acted out, noting it was the third time this happened. Seeing characters and dialogue from her writing performed was an amazing experience.\n  - sisterhood: J