icture or memory discussed originated from a trip to Banff. (event_time: 2023-12-09T13:45:00Z)\n  - Sam cannot feel the same way about Love as Evan seems to. (event_time: 2023-12-26T16:25:00Z)\n  - Evan asks Sam how Sam has been feeling lately. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan considers Sam a person to talk to. (event_time: 2023-11-09T21:13:00Z)\n  - Sam asked Evan about the relaxing nature of the trip to Jasper. (event_time: 2023-05-24T19:11:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - Evan: Evan expressed being in love at first sight with a woman from Canada, feeling a spark and believing in their connection.\n  - SO: Evan met a Canadian woman referred to as his 'new SO' during a trip to Canada; being with her makes him feel alive, and they enjoyed hiking and biking together.\n  - woman from Canada: Evan is in love with the woman from Canada, stating he was in love with her at first sight and questioning why they hadn't married sooner.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam he is in love with a woman from Canada, whom he married, and expressed joy from viewing a painting that helped him recognize his feelings.\n  - Evan: Evan got married last week to the woman from Canada, whom he loved at first sight. He confirmed his love at first sight feeling to Sam.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam he is in love at first sight with a woman from Canada and expressed regret for not marrying her sooner.\n  - Love: Evan expressed being in love at first sight with a woman from Canada, stating he regrets not marrying her sooner.\n  - Evan: Evan told Sam he is in love with a woman, possibly from Canada, and they did not marry sooner.\n  - Canadian woman: Evan met an awesome Canadian woman in Canada last week. Being with her is fun, energizing, and makes him feel alive, offering a nice change after dealing with health issues.\n  - spark: Evan felt a spark inside when he saw the woman from Canada, which made him feel like time stopped 