, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Evan is trying to eat a healthier lifestyle. (event_time: 2023-12-31T11:00:00Z)\n  - Evan suggests that Sam make positive changes for a healthier lifestyle. (event_time: 2023-05-24T19:11:00Z)\n  - Evan offers support to Sam in the journey toward a healthier lifestyle. (event_time: 2023-05-24T19:11:00Z)\n  - Evan is inquiring about how Sam's efforts in living healthier are progressing. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Evan asked Sam if he has made any recent dietary changes. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:55:00Z)\n  - Evan advises Sam to focus on healthy swaps. (event_time: 2023-07-27T10:52:00Z)\n  - Evan emphasized that Sam's health is important. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:09:00Z)\n  - Evan encourages Sam to share updates on his efforts because small changes lead to a healthier life. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:55:00Z)\n  - Sam is asking for help with getting started, likely regarding health/diet changes mentioned previously. (event_time: 2023-06-06T15:55:00Z)\n  - Evan brought up the topic of healthy meals. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Sam is dedicated to staying healthy. (event_time: 2024-01-10T00:17:00Z)\n  - Sam asked Evan what Evan does to stay fit and healthy. (event_time: 2023-11-21T19:30:00Z)\n  - Evan ate more veggies and fruit as part of his dietary changes (event_time: 2023-07-27T10:52:00Z)\n  - Evan asks Sam if he has noticed any positive changes from living healthier. (event_time: 2023-08-19T18:17:00Z)\n  - Evan wants to eat healthy (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan discussed exercise tips with Sam. (event_time: 2024-01-10T00:17:00Z)\n  - Sam is motivated to make positive changes regarding his health (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan suggests that Sam should focus on taking care of themselves, implying it is important. (event_time: 2023-08-15T16:20:00Z)\n  - Evan asks Sam about his progress on fitness goals (event_time: 2023-11-21T19:30:00Z)\n  - Evan